    "description": "The Telecom SIM and eSIM Status Retrieval API allows users to access the current status of telecommunications SIM and eSIM assets. This endpoint provides essential information regarding the availability and operational state of SIMs and eSIMs, which is crucial for network management and customer support operations. Typical consumers include telecom providers and developers integrating mobile services into applications. Use cases include monitoring SIM activation statuses, evaluating stock levels, and managing customer inquiries related to connectivity.",
